					"title": "Avocado Toast",
					"source_url": "",
					"description": "Toast with avocado, lemon, and an optional egg.",
					"image": "",
					"prep_time": "10 min",
					"servings": 2,
					"category": "Breakfast",
					"ingredients": "2 slices sourdough bread\n1 ripe avocado\n1/2 lemon, juiced\nSalt and pepper to taste\nRed pepper flakes (optional)\n2 eggs (optional)",
					"instructions": "Toast the bread until golden and crispy.\nCut avocado in half, remove pit, and scoop flesh into a bowl.\nMash avocado with lemon juice, salt, and pepper.\nSpread avocado mixture on toast.\nTop with red pepper flakes and a fried egg if desired."
				},
