					"ingredients": "12 oz penne pasta\n2 cups mixed vegetables (bell peppers, zucchini, cherry tomatoes)\n3 cloves garlic, minced\n1/4 cup olive oil\n1/2 cup parmesan cheese\nFresh basil\nSalt and pepper",
					"instructions": "Cook pasta according to package directions. Reserve 1 cup pasta water.\nSauté garlic in olive oil until fragrant.\nAdd vegetables and cook until tender-crisp.\nToss pasta with vegetables, adding pasta water as needed.\nTop with parmesan and fresh basil. Season to taste."
